| description = The [[Dark Elf]] Warriors Guild.  The Indigo Brotherhood has struck an alliance with the [[Crushbone Orcs]], sending their Ambassador to Emperor Crush himself. 
It remains to be seen what will come of it.

The Guildhall of the Indigo Brotherhood can be found in the [[Neriak]] Commons.  The guildmaster [[Seloxia Punox]] leads the guild in the opposition of the [[Emerald Warriors]] of 
Kelethin and the [[Steel Warriors]] of Qeynos and Freeport.  Dark Elf warriors also learn young to hunt the Halfling Leatherfoot Raiders who have invaded their Nektulos Forest.

As a rule, you can gain faction with most of the Human and Elvish warrior guilds by annoying these folk.

